  m_text: 'The client mentioned that the <color=#B30000>(fishy smell)<color=#000000>
    might be sewer-related.

    She said that her husband had smelled the same foul
    odor on his clothes when he was covering a story about <color=#B30000>(strange
    sewer mystery)<color=#000000>.'
